<h1>Welcome to your new website</h1>
<div class="text-div">
    <p>This is the homepage of your Trongate Pages powered website. It was created automatically because no homepage existed. Sign in to the admin panel and open this page in edit mode to replace this content with your own.</p>
    <p>Edit mode is available by appending <b>/edit</b> to any webpage URL. Inside the editor you can add headlines, text, images, buttons, YouTube videos, dividers and raw HTML. Click the disk icon in the toolbar to save, and use the settings modal to publish the page.</p>
    <p>Links and image URLs can use the [website] placeholder, which is replaced with your site URL whenever a visitor views the page.</p>
</div>
